Source: https://github.com/Ampixa/sanoTTS  ·  Weights: https://huggingface.co/ampixa/sanoTTS
Builds on piper (https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl) and espeak-ng (https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng), both GPLv3.
The "kristin" voice is distilled from Piper's en_US-kristin voice, trained on public-domain LibriVox recordings.
